pairs?)</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSDAZmOboAAOtSH.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSDAZlzWMAorskj.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2098888979240337854\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2098888979240337854</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2098883865309819366\">https://x.com/i/status/2098883865309819366</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2098888979240337854</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2098888979240337854\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-09-12T21:38:22.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2098878921571778571</dd>\n</dl>"},"2098893054107173269":{"a":"<p>RT @Ghostbusters: Big or small, The Real Ghostbusters bust ‘em all. 🚫👻 Celebrating 40 years in the Firehouse. #RealGhostbusters40th</p>\n<p>☎️ Add…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2098865949055254922\">https://x.com/i/status/2098865949055254922</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2098893054107173269</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2098893054107173269\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-09-12T21:54:34.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2098893054107173269</dd>\n</dl>"},"2098894219267960952":{"a":"<p>Over Time the Brick Patterns are adjusted<br>\nTo Hide the Past Symbols<br>\nWhich have Been Corrupted<br>\nBy Certain Misunderstood Ideals.</p>\n<p>Swiss Windmills for the Mind<br>\nStickers from a Time Long Past. <a hre